## 10. Caveats / status notes

No code/source blocker is known for the declared contract/interface-only scope.

No package, branch-inspection, local-check, or post-merge main-inspection gate remains known for the declared contract/interface-only scope.

No real-runtime test was required because this branch did not touch runtime/worker/lifecycle/native execution surfaces.

The branch remains intentionally non-executable. It defines a backend adapter invocation descriptor target for a future behavior-wiring branch.

Future behavior-wiring branches that actually invoke backend adapters, wire `executeAction()`, touch `workerBridge`, touch `llama_worker`, enqueue runtime requests, stream tokens, schedule/cancel work, load models, or alter lifecycle behavior must define new gates and may require real-runtime testing.

